//@version=6
indicator("UCTPROBE_VW_DRAW_COUNT_AT_CAP", overlay = false, max_boxes_count = 20, max_lines_count = 20, max_labels_count = 20)

// ─── 2026-11-16 — DRAW-1, capture queue Q-DRAW-CAP-1: WHAT TRADINGVIEW HOLDS WHEN A
// FAMILY'S LIVE COUNT REACHES ITS max_*_count, FOR A SCRIPT THAT DOES NOT DRAW EVERY BAR.
//
// The reference says of max_boxes_count / max_lines_count / max_labels_count: "The count is
// approximate; more drawings than the specified count may be displayed." objectPool.js C7
// measured one rule on scripts that draw on EVERY bar (probes vw-object-gc-a..d): a create
// that takes a family past cap + 5 deletes the oldest until cap remain. inside-bar-boxes
// (rddt 1d, 2026-11-14) draws only on some bars and TradingView held 52 boxes at cap 50
// where that rule, run over our replay, holds 50. This probe draws on a sparse, regular
// pattern so each bar's LIVE count (`box.all.size()`) and the number MADE so far can be read
// against each other.
//
// One box, one line and one label on every bar where bar_index % 3 == 0, plus a second box on
// every bar where bar_index % 7 == 0 (two creates on one bar). cap 20 each, so the collector
// is reached by bar ~75 and then runs hundreds of times on 1D SPY.
//   C00  bar_index                CONTROL
//   C01  boxes made so far        (counted by the script, never collected)
//   C02  box.all.size()           what TradingView holds after this bar's creates
//   C03  lines made so far
//   C04  line.all.size()
//   C05  labels made so far
//   C06  label.all.size()
// Box and label texts carry the bar (x/y in the capture are vendor indices, NOT bar_index).
//
// ⛔ CAPTURE: AMEX:SPY 1D and NYSE:RDDT 1D (from the listing), inputs at defaults (none),
// AFTER THE CLOSE. ours today (2026-11-16, feat/pine-coverage-drawings): both lanes run C7's
// rule; the reading this capture settles is whether a sparse script's held count follows it.

var int boxesMade = 0
var int linesMade = 0
var int labelsMade = 0
if bar_index % 3 == 0
    box.new(bar_index, 2.0, bar_index + 1, 1.0, text = "CB " + str.tostring(bar_index))
    boxesMade += 1
    line.new(bar_index, 1.5, bar_index + 1, 1.5)
    linesMade += 1
    label.new(bar_index, 1.0, "CL " + str.tostring(bar_index))
    labelsMade += 1
if bar_index % 7 == 0
    box.new(bar_index, 3.0, bar_index + 1, 2.5, text = "CB7 " + str.tostring(bar_index))
    boxesMade += 1

plot(bar_index, "C00_bar_index_CONTROL")
plot(boxesMade, "C01_boxes_made")
plot(box.all.size(), "C02_boxes_held")
plot(linesMade, "C03_lines_made")
plot(line.all.size(), "C04_lines_held")
plot(labelsMade, "C05_labels_made")
plot(label.all.size(), "C06_labels_held")
